# Start-up (latency.md step 11): the shell restarted five times; the log's
# `started every part … ms after main`, `first-frame … since-main-ms=…` and
# `slow start: …` lines collected. PASS: first frame < 1000 ms every time.
look material
setup : > /tmp/core-startup.txt
